			"notes": "## TailMod v0.1.0 — Initial Release\n\nPlay with friends on your private Tailnet without port forwarding, without public servers.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.1.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.1\n- Fabric API 0.149.1+26.1.2\n\n### Installation\n1. Drop `tailmod-0.1.0.jar` into `.minecraft/mods/`\n2. Launch the game — click **Tailnet** on the title screen\n3. Log in once (browser or auth key) — credentials are saved for auto-connect\n\n### What's included\n- One-click connect to any peer on your Tailnet\n- LAN world sharing — open a LAN world, friends see it instantly in the Tailnet screen\n- SLP ping — shows server version and player count for each online peer\n- Double-click to connect, favorites (★), online-first sorting\n- Auto-reconnect on restart\n- Voice chat proxy (Simple Voice Chat port 24454 + webcam port 25454)\n- Cross-platform natives bundled: Linux x64, macOS x64, macOS arm64"
		}
